    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "The Tropic of Cancer passes through 8 Indian states: Gujarat, Rajasthan, Madhya Pradesh, Chhattisgarh, Jharkhand, West Bengal, Tripura, and Mizoram.",
        "The Indian Standard Meridian (82.5° E) passes through 5 states: Uttar Pradesh, Madhya Pradesh, Chhattisgarh, Odisha, and Andhra Pradesh.",
        "IST is ahead of Greenwich Mean Time (GMT) by 5 hours and 30 minutes (+5:30 UTC).",
        "Mahi River is the only river in India that crosses the Tropic of Cancer twice."
